    // v1.3: the earliest timeline t in [t0, t1) that lies inside an overlay window, -1 if none. LB_Journey asks it once at
    // spawn with t0 = the end of its spawn black and t1 = t0 + its fade-in length: >= 0 means "no fade-in: hold the black
